ffarfima includes code adapted from the following sources.

R/lw.R, R/lpwn.R
  Local Whittle and local polynomial Whittle with noise estimators from the
  LongMemoryTSA package by Christian Leschinski (archived on CRAN).

R/dfa.R
  pengFit() is adapted from the fArma package by Diethelm Wuertz (GPL >= 2),
  a reimplementation of Taqqu, Teverovsky and Willinger (1995).

R/farma.R
  farma_estimation() is adapted from the FARMA estimation code of Thomas Kuenzer
  (version 2024-12-17).

R/sieve_bootstrap.R
  Functional sieve bootstrap; original author to be confirmed.
